  "releaseNotes": "Store-global tree ordinal for document order. Adds XdmNode.TreeOrdinal (settable ulong, default 0), XdmNode.CompareDocumentOrder(a,b), and XdmNode.DocumentOrderKey, defining document order as the pair (TreeOrdinal, Id). NodeId is unique only within a single node store, so nodes from independently-parsed sources could share an id; the tree ordinal groups nodes by originating tree, restoring a total, consistent order and identity key. Default 0 leaves nodes constructed without a store comparing purely by Id, so existing single-source ordering is unchanged. Additive only; no public API removed. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
